    "Smooth: Battery/Volume gradually transitions through all colors\nBattery: Green (high) → Yellow-Green → Yellow → Orange → Red (low)\nVolume: Green (quiet) → Yellow → Orange → Red (loud)": {
      "comment": "A detailed description of the \"Smooth\" color-coded gradient display feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suave: batería/volumen transiciona gradualmente por todos los colores\nBatería: Verde (alto) → Verde amarillento → Amarillo → Naranja → Rojo (bajo)\nVolumen: Verde (bajo) → Amarillo → Naranja → Rojo (alto)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
